msgstr ""
"नमूनानिर्गमः: <replaceable>* उपयोक्ता Slippery When Wet "
"[Amarok]</replaceable> इत्यत्र Bon Jovi इत्यस्य You Give Love A Bad Name "
"इति गीतं शृणोति"

#: index.docbook:2688 index.docbook:2694
#. Tag: userinput
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>/exec </command> <replaceable>sysinfo</replaceable>"
msgstr "<command>/exec </command> <प्रतिस्थापनीय>sysinfo</replaceable>"

#: index.docbook:2691
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This script outputs some detailed information about your system by "
"combining the outputs of several commands and formatting them appropriately."
msgstr ""
"इयं स्क्रिप्ट् अनेकानाम् आदेशानां निर्गमं संयोजयित्वा समुचितरूपेण "
"स्वरूपयित्वा भवतः प्रणाल्याः विषये काश्चन विस्तृताः सूचनाः निर्गच्छन्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:2693
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Example: To output some information about your system to the current "
"channel tab."
msgstr ""
"उदाहरणम् : वर्तमानचैनलट्याब् मध्ये भवतः प्रणाल्याः विषये काश्चन सूचनाः "
"निर्गन्तुम् ।"

#: index.docbook:2695
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sample output: <replaceable>Sysinfo for 'user-desktop': Running inside KDE "
"Plasma 5.6.5 on Ubuntu 16.04.1 LTS (Xenial Xerus) powered by Linux "
"4.4.0-47-generic, CPU: Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4910MQ CPU @ 2.90GHz at "
"2996-3338/3900 MHz, RAM: 15795/15967 MB, Storage: 1591/2281 GB, 406 procs, "
"47.59h up</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"नमूनानिर्गमः: <replaceable>'user-desktop' कृते Sysinfo: Linux "
"4.4.0-47-generic, CPU: Intel(R) Core( TM) i7-4910MQ CPU @ 2.90GHz पर "
"२९९६-३३३८/३९०० मेगाहर्ट्ज, रैम: १५७९५/१५९६७ एमबी, भण्डारण: १५९१/२२८१ जीबी, "
"४०६ प्रोक्स, ४७.५९h अप</replaceable>"

#: index.docbook:2700
#. Tag: userinput
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>/exec </command> <replaceable>tinyurl</replaceable> "
"[<replaceable>Link Address</replaceable>]"
msgstr ""
"<command>/exec </command> <replaceable>tinyurl</replaceable> "
"[<replaceable>लिङ्कसङ्केतः</replaceable>] ।"

#: index.docbook:2703
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This script uses Tinyurl's api to turn the given link into a tinyurl that "
"is then sent to the current channel tab."
msgstr ""
"इयं स्क्रिप्ट् दत्तं लिङ्कं tinyurl मध्ये परिणतुं Tinyurl इत्यस्य api "
"इत्यस्य उपयोगं करोति यत् ततः वर्तमानचैनल ट्याब् प्रति प्रेष्यते ।"

#: index.docbook:2704
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example: To give someone a short link to https://konversation.kde.org"
msgstr "उदाहरणम् : कस्मैचित् https://konversation.kde.org इत्यस्य लघुलिङ्कं दातुं"

#: index.docbook:2705
#. Tag: userinput
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>/exec </command> <replaceable>tinyurl "
"https://konversation.kde.org</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"<command>/exec </command> <replaceable>tinyurl "
"https://konversation.kde.org</replaceable> इति"

#: index.docbook:2706
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sample output: <replaceable>https://tinyurl.com/y4rk8wa3</replaceable>"
msgstr "नमूनानिर्गमः <replaceable>https://tinyurl.com/y4rk8wa3</replaceable>"

#: index.docbook:2711 index.docbook:2716
#. Tag: userinput
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>/exec </command> <replaceable>uptime</replaceable>"
msgstr "<command>/exec </command> <प्रतिस्थापनीय>अपटाइम</replaceable>"

#: index.docbook:2714
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This script outputs the result of the command \"uptime\" and formats it "
"appropriately."
msgstr ""
"एषा स्क्रिप्ट् \"uptime\" इति आदेशस्य परिणामं निर्गच्छति, तस्य समुचितरूपेण "
"स्वरूपणं च करोति ।"

#: index.docbook:2715
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example: To show off your rock solid 98 day uptime."
msgstr "उदाहरणम् : स्वस्य शिला ठोस 98 दिवसस्य अपटाइमं दर्शयितुं।"

#: index.docbook:2717
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sample output: <replaceable>Uptime: 98 days, 15 hours and 2 "
"minutes</replaceable>"
msgstr ""
"नमूनानिर्गमः : <replaceable>अपसमयः : ९८ दिवसाः, १५ घण्टाः २ निमेषाः "
"च</replaceable>"

#: index.docbook:2723
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"All these scripts have predefined command aliases. In &konversation;'s "
"settings dialog select <menuchoice><guimenu>Behavior</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Command Aliases</guimenuitem></menuchoice> to view, add, "
